                  "fill": "$text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "1px inner stroke glass-border. Sheen = two 1px lines, glass-sheen-top and glass-sheen-bottom (site: inset 0 1px / 0 −1px). Pencil does not honor inner shadows (stored as outer), so the sheen is emulated with lines; in Flutter use a border or gradient stroke.",
