                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "SGzso",
                  "name": "Rule Detail",
                  "fill": "$text-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Only text-heading and text-body at ≥ 12 px; never text-muted or text-faint (the backdrop moves). Measured, text-body on glass-tint: light over bg-page / surface-card 10.1 / 10.3 : 1, over orange-500 5.1 : 1 (pass), over sand-900 2.4 : 1 (fail); dark over bg-page / surface-card 10.5 / 10.0 : 1 (pass), over orange-400 / orange-500 2.9 / 3.8 : 1 (fail). So bright orange content (PromoBanner) must not scroll under dark glass, nor dark imagery under light glass. Where the backdrop is unpredictable use glass-tint-strong (80%: light #FFFFFFCC, dark #1C1918CC), which measured ≥ 5.2 : 1 body text over every case above.",
                  "lineHeight": "$type-body-sm-lh",
                  "fontFamily": "$font-family",
                  "fontSize": "$type-body-sm-size",
                  "fontWeight": "$font-weight-regular",
                  "letterSpacing": "$type-body-sm-tracking"
