        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "rRZyf",
          "name": "Handoff Notes",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "yEwpK",
              "name": "Note Motion",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "MOTION\nChip select: 150 ms ease-out (fill + border cross-fade, check icon fades/scales in). Text field focus: 150 ms border color/width change. Error: border + message appear together, no shake here (OTP shake belongs to S03).\nReduce motion: state changes are instant.\nTheme switch is instant."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "duaeK",
              "name": "Note Keyboard",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "KEYBOARD + FOCUS ORDER\nTab moves label -> field -> suffix button -> next field; Shift+Tab reverses. Enter in a single-line field moves to the next field or submits (textInputAction). Chips: Space/Enter toggles, arrow keys move within a chip row. Sticky footers (S11, S15, S16) stay above the keyboard inset; fields scroll into view above it.\nFocused text field = 2 dp focus-ring border (intentional exception to the 2 dp offset ring: the border itself is the indicator, 3.3 : 1 on page)."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "Q9AOr",
              "name": "Note Semantics",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "SEMANTICS + FIGURES\nTextField: label read with value and helper; error text is a live region ('Nomor HP belum valid'). Chip: Semantics(button, selected). Count badge is read inside the label ('Filter, 2 dipilih'). Suffix clear = TsIconButton 'Hapus isian'.\nCounter '0/250' uses tabular figures (FontFeature.tabularFigures(); verify Exo 2 ships tnum, else fixed-width slot).\nText scale 1.3: labels wrap above the box, the field box grows only for multiline; chips grow in width, rows wrap."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
