        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "PRzQf",
          "name": "Handoff Notes",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "Si8lP",
              "name": "Note Snackbar",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "SNACKBAR BEHAVIOR (Flutter: ScaffoldMessenger)\nSuccess / info without an action: auto-dismiss after 4 s. A snackbar with an action or an error stays until the user acts, dismisses it (swipe) or a new one replaces it; never a timer. Announce as a polite live region (SemanticsService.announce); an error that blocks the task also leaves an inline message on screen.\nEnter 250 ms ease-out slide + fade, exit 150 ms; reduce motion: fade only. One at a time, 12 dp above the NavBar (tablet: bottom-center, max-width 560). The action keeps a 48 dp target; focused = 2 dp accent-on-inverse ring (>= 5 : 1 on the inverse surface in both modes)."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "vyGfi",
              "name": "Note Dialog",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "DIALOG BEHAVIOR\nOpen: scrim over the page, focus moves to the title (never to the destructive button) and is trapped inside; Tab cycles, Escape / system back = cancel (same as the Ghost action). Close: focus returns to the control that opened it.\nConfirm-destructive: cancel is the de-emphasized Ghost, confirm is solid Danger with icon + explicit label, and the body states the consequence (what is lost or released). Choice dialog = radio group: arrow keys move, Space selects, focused row = 2 dp focus-ring. Tablet: centered, max-width 560. Enter 250 ms fade + 8 dp rise; reduce motion: fade only."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "TaRnV",
              "name": "Note Badge",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 0,
              "content": "BADGE SEMANTICS + MOTION\nUnitStatusBadge is read as one label ('Status: Dikerjakan'); the icon is excluded from semantics. Status is never only the tint: icon + label are always present in both sizes. Terjadwal carries a 1 px border-default so it stays visible on surface-inset rows. A status change cross-fades tint + icon in 150 ms; reduce motion: instant. Label Small 11 px is the PRD 02 badge size (kept at the step 02 review)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
