        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Rd81b",
          "name": "Handoff Notes",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "AaL6j",
              "name": "Note Motion",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 447,
              "content": "MOTION\nPress: 150 ms ease-out, state change only (Primary/Danger fill -> accent-pressed/danger-pressed; Secondary/Outline border -> border-accent; Ghost fill -> accent-soft; icon button state layer).\nLoading: label swaps to a 20 dp spinner (progress_activity, 1 rotation/s); the button keeps its width (instance width override = the label button's width, or fill_container). Ignore taps while loading.\nReduce motion (MediaQuery.disableAnimations): no press animation, spinner shows a static progress arc."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "OPc7w",
              "name": "Note Focus",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 384,
              "content": "FOCUS + KEYBOARD (tablet, hardware keyboard, switch access)\nFocused = 2 dp focus-ring, 2 dp gap (Flutter: Focus + a DecoratedBox outside the button, never clipped: leave 4 dp around). Order follows reading order, top-to-bottom then left-to-right; the destructive action is never the default-focused control in a dialog. Enter / Space activates.\nDanger solid: only as the confirm inside TsDialog. On-screen destructive trigger = Danger Outline with icon + explicit label, always followed by a confirm dialog."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "Wziug",
              "name": "Note Semantics",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 510,
              "content": "SEMANTICS (Flutter)\nTsIconButton needs a label: back = 'Kembali', close = 'Tutup', bell = 'Notifikasi, 3 belum dibaca', clear = 'Hapus isian', retry = 'Coba lagi', search = 'Cari', overflow = 'Menu lainnya'.\nLoading button: Semantics(label: '<label>, sedang memproses', enabled: false).\nDisabled buttons stay in the a11y tree (announced 'dimmed'); a reason is given in the helper line above the sticky bar, not in the button.\nHit area: every master is >= 48 x 48 dp (compact = 40 dp visual inside a 48 dp frame). Heights are minimums, not fixed: a label that wraps or a larger text scale grows the button (Flutter: ConstrainedBox minHeight 48)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
