          "children": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "pfaRZ",
              "name": "Note Service Tiles",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 384,
              "content": "SERVICE TILES: SELECTION MODEL\nDefault = checkbox multi-select (a unit may take Servis Berkala + Ganti Oli); at least one service per unit is required before Lanjut. Radio style is kept for an exclusive group. Choosing a requiresComplaint service turns on the Keluhan section for that unit (note in S11).\nPrice is always an estimate: meta line reads '60 mnt · Estimasi'. Format Rp85.000 (id_ID).\nSemantics: 'Servis Berkala, 60 menit, estimasi Rp85.000, dipilih'. Disabled tile reads its reason."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "Y1Gao",
              "name": "Note Part Tiles",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 447,
              "content": "PART TILES: COMPATIBILITY\nS11 shortlist is already filtered by MotorModel.category + cc, so incompatible rows appear there only after a 'Salin dari' copy is reported. S12 shows every part with a Cocok / Tidak cocok badge; incompatible tiles are disabled and state the unit in the reason ('Tidak cocok untuk Beat 110').\nCategory icon tile replaces a photo (oli oil_barrel, kampas build, aki battery_charging_full, ban tire_repair); a photo later takes the 1:1 / 16:9 slot.\nGrid card: 156 dp, 2-col phone / 3-4 col expanded; mark sits top-right over the image slot."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "A8YyE6",
              "name": "Note Tile Behavior",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 300,
              "content": "TILE BEHAVIOR\nWhole tile taps; the mark is the visible state. Motion: border + mark 150 ms ease-out, reduce motion = instant. Tiles wrap long names (no fixed height) and keep the price on one line; at text scale 1.3 the tile grows, the price never truncates.\nFocus: 2 dp focus-ring outside the border (specimen wrapper); selected + focused keeps both."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
