              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Two-tone, every fill bound to a semantic token (body text-body, highlights surface-inset, accent stripe accent) so the art follows the theme. Left to right: Hero 96 dp (S09 hero, display grid) matic / bebek / sport, then Card 64 dp matic / bebek / sport.",
              "lineHeight": "$type-body-sm-lh",
