        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "ZI18S",
          "name": "Handoff Notes",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "uvHzQ",
              "name": "Note Selection Marks",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 405,
              "content": "SELECTION MARKS + FOCUS\n48 dp target around a 24 dp glyph; the whole card / tile is also tappable. Checkbox: Space/Enter toggles. Radio group (services in an exclusive group, S17 vouchers): arrow keys move, Space selects. Focus = 2 dp focus-ring at a 2 dp offset (specimen: enable the Focus Ring child).\nSemantics: 'Vario 125, AB 1234 XY, dipilih' / 'tidak dipilih'; a disabled card reads its reason as the hint ('Sedang dalam servis').\nMotion: check / dot scale-in 150 ms ease-out; reduce motion = instant."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "mkFck",
              "name": "Note Tab Chips",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 573,
              "content": "TAB CHIPS: SCROLL + SNAP\nThe row is a horizontal list that snaps to chip starts; the active chip scrolls into view (250 ms). When the row overflows, a 24 dp bg-page fade (token bg-page-clear to bg-page) sits on the cut edge and the next chip peeks; Flutter: ShaderMask or a gradient overlay. Hidden when only one unit is selected.\nAt expanded / large width the rail-row variant replaces the chips (list-detail).\nSemantics: 'Beat 110, tab 2 dari 3, sedang diisi'. State text: Lengkap / Sedang diisi / Belum lengkap / Pilih layanan dulu (error), so the glyph is never the only signal; the error chip pairs with the inline message in the unit card (step 07). Nickname: Text(maxLines: 1, overflow: ellipsis) on the chip; the full name is in the unit header below and in the semantics label."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "R2WV0z",
              "name": "Note Cards and Silhouettes",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 615,
              "content": "CARDS + SILHOUETTES\nSelect mode: selected = 2 dp border-accent + checked mark (color is never the only signal). Once 5 motors are selected the remaining unselected cards switch to Disabled Max Reached; motors with an active booking are Disabled In Service. The reason is a text badge in its own row under the card, not only a dimmed card.\nNickname: maxLines 2 then ellipsis (tap selects on S10, so the full value stays in the semantics label and on S09). Silhouette = MotorModel.category (matic / bebek / sport), 1:1 box; a photo replaces it and falls back to the silhouette on load error. Silhouette art uses text-body / surface-inset / accent tokens, so no separate dark asset; the tile radius is radius-sm so it stays concentric inside the 16 dp card with 12 dp padding.\nDisplay mode: whole card taps to S09. Compact mode: Home strip, horizontal scroll, next card peeks."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
