          "name": "Handoff Notes",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "F4IBq",
              "name": "Note Stepper",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 384,
              "content": "BOOKING STEPPER\nS10 = step 1, S11 = 2, S13 + S15 = 3, S16 = 4; single-motor bookings show the same four steps. Steps are not tappable (the flow is linear; edit links live on S16). Phone: circles + one caption row so 'Bengkel & Jadwal' never truncates; wide: all four labels inline. The completion badge (2/3) is S11 only.\nSemantics: 'Langkah 2 dari 4, Servis, 2 dari 3 motor lengkap' announced once when the screen opens. Motion: line fills 250 ms ease-out, reduce motion instant."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "B9jG2i",
              "name": "Note Estimate Bar",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 573,
              "content": "ESTIMATE BAR: KEYBOARD + GLASS\nPinned above the gesture inset with 16 dp side margins; when the keyboard opens (S11 complaint field) it rides above the keyboard inset, never behind it. Recompute: total swaps to a skeleton and the CTA to its loading state; the CTA never enables while a unit lacks a service (reason line names the unit).\nGlass = BackdropFilter blur 14 + glass-tint 42 %; text only text-heading (measured over the worst-case backdrops: >= 7.4 : 1 light, >= 4.7 : 1 dark, so the 42 % tint stays in both themes). Fallback when blur is unavailable or contrast measures < 4.5 : 1: flat surface-card + shadow-md. Total uses tabular figures (FontFeature.tabularFigures(); verify Exo 2 ships tnum).\nSemantics: 'Estimasi Rp228.000, 1 jam. Lanjut'; updates announce politely (live region)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
