            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "vOV00",
              "name": "Note Promo",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 468,
              "content": "PROMO CAROUSEL\nData-driven (promos.json): title, body, CTA label, icon, deep link. Cards are 304 dp on phone so the next card peeks 32 dp; page dots below (PageIndicator, active = 20 x 8 pill in accent-fill, others border-control dots). The dots are a position cue only: not tappable, excluded from semantics. Autoplay is off by default; if enabled, it pauses on touch and never runs with reduce motion. Swipe to move.\nSemantics: the viewport announces 'Promo 1 dari 3, Diskon 10 persen untuk servis 2 motor atau lebih, tombol Pakai voucher'. Text scale 1.3: the card grows, the icon disc keeps its size."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "x88FP1",
              "name": "Note Voucher",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 363,
              "content": "VOUCHER CARD\nSingle choice (radio group). Eligibility comes from the domain (minUnits, minSubtotal); the saving line is computed for the current booking; an ineligible voucher stays in the list, disabled, with the exact reason in text (Butuh min. 2 motor). 'Tidak pakai voucher' is a plain row with a TsRadio (S17, step 10).\nSemantics: 'Diskon 10 persen servis 2 motor atau lebih, hemat Rp42.800, dipilih' / '... tidak berlaku, butuh minimal 2 motor'."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "PUMVu",
              "name": "Note Ticket",
              "width": 340,
              "height": 489,
              "content": "TICKET CARD\nQR encodes the booking code TS-260929-0417 (qr_flutter); minimum footprint 176 dp = 144 dp code + 16 dp quiet zone on every side; the QR tile is a fixed light tile (sand-0 / sand-900), so it stays dark-on-light in dark mode. Notches are bg-page ellipses (Decor), so the ticket only sits on bg-page; on any other surface use the dashed line without notches.\nSemantics: the ticket is one group ('Tiket servis, kode TS-260929-0417, 3 motor, Bengkel Jaya Motor, Selasa 29 September 2026 pukul 09.00'); the QR has the code as its text alternative. Unit status badges update live (step 16). Landscape: ticket left (max 480), per-unit panel right."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
