        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "i8gY2P",
          "name": "Handoff Notes",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "GIEFu",
              "name": "Note Usage",
              "width": 440,
              "height": 321,
              "content": "SHELL USAGE\nAppShell = status bar (24) + Content slot + glass NavBar (absolute, 16 dp side inset, 12 dp above the 24 dp gesture bar) + gesture bar. A screen is an instance: override the instance height to the content height and the Nav Bar y to height - 100, then put the TsAppBar and the scrolling content in the slot.\nContent scrolls behind the bar: bottom padding above the gesture bar = 64 + 12 + 16 = 92 dp (116 dp in Flutter, which counts the 24 dp inset) so the last item clears it at the end of the scroll."
            },
            {
              "type": "note",
              "id": "DU7jk",
              "name": "Note Behavior",
              "width": 440,
              "height": 237,
              "content": "NAV BEHAVIOR\nDestinations: Beranda, Riwayat, Garasi, Profil (S05, S19, S07, S25). Switching a tab keeps each tab's scroll position (IndexedStack / StatefulShellRoute). Glass budget: NavBar is 1 of max 2 BackdropFilter widgets per screen; flat fallback = glass-tint-strong without the blur.\nSemantics: 'Beranda, tab 1 dari 4, terpilih'."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
