              "content": "RAIL + CONTENT (MEDIUM)\nNavRail 80 dp + content. Content max-width 720 dp, centered, with a 2-col card grid where PRD 06 lists it. The app bar in the slot has no logo (the rail carries TsLogo): greeting as title, bell on the right. Rail height = fill_container; screens override the instance height (1280 portrait)."
