              "name": "Note Focus",
              "width": 520,
              "height": 219,
              "content": "FOCUS + KEYBOARD\nArrow keys move between destinations, Enter / Space selects, Tab leaves the rail. Focus = 2 dp focus-ring on the item pill. The rail switches Medium -> Large by width (>= 1200 dp, PRD 06 layout class), never by shortestSide alone."
            }
