          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "NsYpg",
              "name": "Notes Row 1",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "HXC9s",
                  "name": "Note Taps",
                  "width": 540,
                  "height": 237,
                  "content": "S05 TAPS (PRD 03 / 04)\nBooking CTA -> S10 (nothing pre-selected). ActiveBookingCard (whole card, >= 48 dp) -> S20; 'Lihat invoice' -> S23. DraftResumeCard: body and 'Lanjutkan' resume at the last step; 'Hapus draft' opens the confirm dialog, then the draft is removed. Garage card -> S09; 'Tambah motor' tile -> S08; 'Lihat semua' -> S07. Quick links: Riwayat -> S19, Katalog suku cadang -> S12. Bell -> S06."
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "nhSit",
                  "name": "Note Progress",
                  "width": 540,
                  "height": 363,
                  "content": "FLEETPROGRESS (mini) + STATUS LABEL RULE\nOne segment per unit (max 5), filled by that unit's stage: Terjadwal 0, Antre 1/5, Diperiksa 2/5, Dikerjakan 3/5, QC 4/5, Selesai full (success). Height 6, gap 4, 1 dp border-control outline, empty part surface-inset (fill vs track >= 3:1, empty track visible). Never the only signal: the status line carries a UnitStatusBadge + text.\nDomain layer: leading status = the unit status shared by most units, ties -> earliest stage. Caption 'N motor masih <status>' when units differ; all Selesai -> 'Semua motor selesai' + 'Lihat invoice'.\nSemantics: 'Booking aktif TS-260929-0417, 3 motor, Dikerjakan. Motor 1 Dikerjakan, motor 2 Dikerjakan, motor 3 Diperiksa. Ketuk untuk detail.'"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "z8kYJ0",
              "name": "Notes Row 2",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "gap": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "wIIV8",
                  "name": "Note Draft",
                  "width": 540,
                  "height": 342,
                  "content": "DRAFT RULES\nA draft lives 24 h (PRD 03); the expiry line is always visible and, under 3 h, switches to warning-text + hourglass icon (never color alone). Draft motors must be free: a motor in service cannot be selected. 'Hapus draft' opens TsDialog Confirm Destructive: ghost cancel, danger confirm with icon + label.\n'Lanjutkan' is Secondary (tonal): the filled primary is reserved for the booking CTA in the same viewport.\nFocus: 2 dp focus-ring border on the card; nested buttons keep their own ring; tab order card, Hapus draft, Lanjutkan.\nSemantics: 'Draft booking, Supra X 125, langkah 2 dari 4, kedaluwarsa dalam 22 jam'."
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "bL3Kc",
                  "name": "Note Garage",
                  "width": 540,
                  "height": 321,
                  "content": "GARAGE STRIP + STACK\nHorizontal scroll, 16 dp lead, 12 dp gap, the next card peeks (hidden content needs a cue). In-service motors carry the compact badge; a tap still opens S09 where 'Booking motor ini' is blocked ('Sedang dalam servis'). Long nicknames: maxLines 2 + ellipsis (the frame shows the truncated result); the full value is in the semantics label and on S09. Free motors have no badge; cards in a row keep equal height.\nStack: at most 2 ActiveBookingCards, then 'Lihat semua (n)' -> S19 Berlangsung.\nSemantics: 'Vario 125, AB 1234 XY, sedang dikerjakan'. Bell: 'Notifikasi, 2 belum dibaca'."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
