    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "aVgrc",
      "x": 5280,
      "y": 41286,
      "name": "S10 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Portrait",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "pCYj7",
          "name": "S10 Handoff Note · Tablet-Portrait",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 321,
          "content": "TABLET-PORTRAIT (800)\nNo NavRail in the booking flow. App bar full width; content column 720 centered; wide BookingStepper; 2-column card grid (16 dp gaps). The last cell holds the add card, stretched to the row height; when it stands alone (max-reached, 6 motors) it takes the full row. Footer spans the frame, its row padded to 40 dp so the counter and Lanjut align with the content edge. The exit dialog is the same 312 dp centered modal on every breakpoint."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "FP1bN",
      "x": 5440,
      "y": 42886,
      "name": "S10 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Landscape",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "qGzAz",
          "name": "S10 Handoff Note · Tablet-Landscape",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 258,
          "content": "TABLET-LANDSCAPE (1280)\nNo NavRail. Content column max 1040 centered, 3-column grid: 5 cards + add card = 3 + 3. Footer row padded to 120 dp. Frames are 1280 x 800 viewports (5 motors fit without scrolling); with more motors the list scrolls and the footer stays sticky. Rotation keeps the selection and the draft."
        }
      ]
    },
