        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "B7BAr",
          "name": "Handoff Notes",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 24,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "pRVLB",
              "name": "Notes Row 1",
              "gap": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "ClgPm",
                  "name": "Note Active Chip",
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 321,
                  "content": "ACTIVE UNIT CHIP\nSelected = 2 dp border + soft fill; unselected = 1 dp border. The status glyph is kept in both: check = lengkap, empty circle = belum lengkap, error = keluhan / layanan kurang. The N/3 badge in the stepper counts the check units. Semantics: 'Beat 110, lengkap, dipilih' / 'PCX 160, keluhan belum diisi, dipilih'. Select 150 ms; MediaQuery.disableAnimations = instant. Amends the step 04 chip (old 'active' glyph was a status-hiding dot)."
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "yXpSu",
                  "name": "Note Copy",
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 384,
                  "content": "SALIN DARI\nRow is hidden with fewer than 2 units or when no other unit has selections. Exactly one source: row names it, one tap copies. Two or more: row opens the source sheet (phone bottom sheet, tablet centered modal); tapping a source copies at once. Copy REPLACES the unit's services and compatible parts, never the complaint. Snackbar 'Disalin dari Beat 110' + Urungkan (about 6 s, action focusable) restores the previous selection. Dropped parts stay in the note until the parts change. Semantics: 'Salin dari Vario 125, tombol'."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "nTdQ7",
              "name": "Notes Row 2",
              "gap": 24,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "Ime6I",
                  "name": "Note Complaint",
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 363,
                  "content": "KELUHAN\nCollapsed 'Tambah keluhan (opsional)' by default; expands on tap (250 ms). Ticking Perbaikan/Keluhan expands it, adds the 'Wajib diisi' badge and blocks Lanjut until the note is not empty: error = icon + text + 2 dp border, the unit chip goes to error. Preset chips toggle and append / remove their label in the note (counts toward 250). Counter is a polite live region from 90 % ('sisa 25'). P2 photo row would sit under the field (not built). Field label for TalkBack: 'Catatan keluhan untuk PCX 160'."
                },
                {
                  "type": "note",
                  "id": "cXkkC",
                  "name": "Note Remove Keyboard",
                  "width": 380,
                  "height": 342,
                  "content": "HAPUS UNIT + KEYBOARD\nRemove icon: 'Keluarkan Beat 110 dari booking', hidden with one unit. A unit without selections is removed at once; with selections the destructive dialog asks first (Batal is the default focus). Down to one unit: chip row and stepper badge hide, chips recompute. System / Keyboard is a design-only block: with the keyboard open the content scrolls so the field stays visible and the sticky bar sits directly above the keyboard, the gesture bar belongs to the keyboard."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
