    {
      "id": "tabHU",
      "type": "ref",
      "ref": "kcsFb",
      "name": "Row Header / S11 Detail Servis · Tablet-Portrait",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 43900,
      "descendants": {
        "Gpvrl": {
          "content": "07"
        },
        "YUYHZ": {
          "content": "S11 Detail Servis · Tablet-Portrait"
        },
        "Hd5hK": {
          "content": "800 × 1280, no NavRail (focused flow): stepper + unit chips pinned, only the form scrolls, glass pill 720 dp: single, multi, complaint required (scrolled), copy source modal, complete, loading, error, remove dialog; dark multi at the end of the row."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "a5QLkm",
      "x": 7920,
      "y": 44086,
      "name": "S11 Handoff Notes · Tablet-Portrait",
      "gap": 24,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "id": "y7whC",
          "name": "Note Tablet-Portrait",
          "width": 380,
          "height": 405,
          "content": "TABLET-PORTRAIT (600-839 dp)\nStepper and unit chips stay pinned under the app bar; only the form scrolls (Complaint Required is drawn scrolled 100 dp so the error stays above the pill). Content column 720 dp centered. The glass pill is 720 dp wide, floats 16 dp above the bottom edge and content scrolls under it (the blur shows the cards). Multi Unit: PCX is incomplete, so the pill is disabled with 'Pilih layanan untuk PCX 160'. Dialogs are identical at every width; the Salin dari source sheet is a centered 560 dp modal here (scrim, focus trap, Esc closes). No status / gesture bar drawn on tablet frames, as the S05 / S10 tablets."
        }
      ]
    },
